ooth connection : \u25cfPairing in 4 second,,, \u25cfpaired device auto connect 2 second to 4 second . \u25cfMy device 3 second auto connect . 5/5Bluetooth range : \u25cfStraight 75...'), Document(id='2b1d0b5faa2143008c0ee432709de7e9', metadata={'product_name': 'OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content="Great product Very much useful for us. It has all the best... Like sound quality, battery back up, buid quality, fitting in the \U0001f442.. I recommend it for buy everyperson who's like wireless headphones..."), Document(id='beea6ed2a8c54206a4be76240507b94f', metadata={'product_name': 'OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content="Looking nice product...I got just 1day delivery..11th I ordered...12th I received...in this price range this product is no1..I got blue...i gift to dear one.. must buy.. don't go other products on this price range is this best....next level headset...no other gives this much battery life 20hrs...mind blowing OnePlus bullet z.. presently I'm using realme wireless buds, both are best in this segment but OnePlus is more battery life n extra multiple device connectivity button n latest design..."), Document(id='af8a4f561b3b4f2fa18e9998622acd27', metadata={'product_name': 'U&I Titanic Series - Low Price Bluetooth Neckband Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content='Awesome quality this headfone and sound quality is very nice best disgn and thank flipkart'), Document(id='b74f21f2f14447419fb7c94db7a8fe18', metadata={'product_name': 'OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content='Best budget Bluetooth earphones by one plus ....sound quality superb.....bass also good .... vry good built quality ....fix 15 hours play back ....very fast order delivery by flipkart ....over all good'), Document(id='c8c0e750175241e1afc191abc2a6a344', metadata={'product_name': 'OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content='Super super head phones.the sound quality is absolutely amazing.and battery life is good.'), Document(id='71be70bd56544671bb4efb614f2b7139', metadata={'product_name': 'realme Buds 2 Wired Headset'}, page_content='every thing is great in this earphone just lacks clarity a bit and i guess its because of bass. cable: braidedlooks cool with black yellow combinationi like the magnetic earbuds'), Document(id='b530013af10f4a03ac4762481d2ffeb0', metadata={'product_name': 'OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content='Bought these headphones 3 weeks backPros:1. excellent build quality2. Great bass and sound3. light weight and handy4. gives me 10hrs of battery back up5. really good quick chargeCons:1. Missing quick switch button'), Document(id='752750f279844162a7e0cdfca58f6910', metadata={'product_name': 'realme Buds Q Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content='If u want earbuds for gaming like pubgm and cod and listening to music go for it If u want for call purpose go for some other cause u have to speak very very loud so that the other person could hear my voice but all the rest things are perfect specially battery backup is so good I almost get atleast 7 hours at 70% volume when gaming from when i take the buds out of the charging caseThe design is good.There is no led in buds but only one in charging case to show that the case is charging o...'), Document(id='3ef4da1dd5174a7883ed6583b9560bd8', metadata={'product_name': 'realme Buds 2 Wired Headset'}, page_content="The Real Buds 2 (Feel The Real Bass)Design & Fit 5 - \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50Sound Clarity & Bass 5 - \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 \u2b50\u2b50Value For Money  5 - \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50I Am Using For My OnePlus 6T ,I Got Best Budget Earphone From Realme \U0001f64f\U0001f64f& Thanks To Flipkart Team For Within 2day FastDelivery ...Just Add To Cart & Buy This , Don't Wait........."), Document(id='51513a8f74394669979f9beb30f99cb3', metadata={'product_name': 'BoAt Rockerz 235v2 with ASAP charging Version 5.0 Bluetooth Headset'}, page_content="Mic is not proper recipient persons can't hear proper sound ( every time for call I heard from front I can't hear you so I have to again talk to through Mobile phone no Option useless of wirless meaning)  and sound quality is so loud. Like local headphones. not comfortable to wear for more than1 hrs of uses.tere is no meanings to get replaced again you get same product therefore this is wast of money.")], 'answer': 'Here are the product names mentioned in the provided data:\n\n- Flipkart SmartBuy Bass Beatz  \n- Boat Airdopes\u202f131  \n- Realme Buds Bluetooth  \n- OnePlus Bullet\u202fZ  \n- Realme Wireless Buds  \n- Real Buds\u202f2 (Feel The Real Bass)'}
