2026-03-22 03:01:01,630 - astrapy.utils.request_tools - DEBUG - Response text: '{"data":{"documents":[{"_id":"e9bccd54d59c47e993fc313faa5ecedf","content":"Best earphone","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"9343a37f3e944a0ba552fd646da1c7ad","content":"I wish to point out one very basic thing the earbuds are designed well but the material used for covering the sound outlet is no good it in good brands its steel or metal based very fine mesh, in this case it  just came out to be nothing but a cloth based thin layer pasted with low quality glue. Not a good experience. Earbud without this cover is firstly exposed and not so appealing anymore.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"c8c0e750175241e1afc191abc2a6a344","content":"Super super head phones.the sound quality is absolutely amazing.and battery life is good.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bass Edition Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"3927748ade13473fb1500ce33fe940e6","content":"Awesome product in such a low price...didn't expected..I never loved any earphone than samsung in ear headphones even akg headphones couldn't beat that and this realme bud is exactly like samsung in ear...loved it must buy","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Q Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"d5842583baeb4a33b8cf5df8afd3d7f1","content":"nice very beautiful Realme buds Very good soundbass quality very nice battery backup good","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"b74f21f2f14447419fb7c94db7a8fe18","content":"Best budget Bluetooth earphones by one plus ....sound quality superb.....bass also good .... vry good built quality ....fix 15 hours play back ....very fast order delivery by flipkart ....over all good","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"d8bc1f2d0ef646a98c0cbde42cc378ee","content":"Worst product ever bought. Instead, you can go and try for \"Flipkart smartbuy bass beatz\". A very decent earphones in very reasonable price. Never go for boat airdopes 131 as this is just good in look and WORST in performance. Could have given 0 star if available in option.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"2357f915e8684fdd87d845e5ae9fbb9d","content":"Very good product.. loved the color and sound quality \u2764\ufe0f It came with extra pairs of earbuds, overall the product is nice and worth money! Thank you Flipkart\uD83D\uDE0A","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt BassHeads 100 Wired Headset"}},{"_id":"39ae12d9868a4a2dbf62b964b422f83c","content":"The best in class airdopes. Great sound, perfect fit and at this price it's just awesome. Highly recommended.The only issue is that Boat has mentioned additional earmuffs with the package but it is not available in the box or it is missing.","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"2b1d0b5faa2143008c0ee432709de7e9","content":"Great product Very much useful for us. It has all the best... Like sound quality, battery back up, buid quality, fitting in the \uD83D\uDC42.. I recommend it for buy everyperson who's like wireless headphones...","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"d09d80b82c7a49c9ac580e03e7d9c1e8","content":"Best quality earphone ever I used excellent sound quality superb battery backup looking Also Good fully worth","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"U&I Titanic Series - Low Price Bluetooth Neckband Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"93db28eecc784792b9daca8697d1d243","content":"Realme Buds Bluetooth used details and ratingBattery : 14 hour Music Playing 5/5Key Controller : 4/5Design : flexib